Third-party / asset notes:
- All game artwork in this repo is ORIGINAL: procedurally drawn SVG assets
  (public/assets/logo.svg, favicon.svg) and emoji glyphs rendered via system
  fonts (emoji themselves are provided by the operating system/browser).
- Fictional hardware brands/names (Nyx, Coreforge, Hexa, Voltcore, Cryoform,
  Aeroflux, Datavault, Ironbox, etc.) are invented for this game; any
  resemblance to real companies is coincidental.
- Open-source dependencies (React, Zustand, Vite, TypeScript, Vitest) remain
  under their own MIT-compatible licenses as listed in package.json.
